OL,3,GNEWSAWife drugged and raped by husband
OL,4,Aasked police if she was to blame
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This article contains
OL,7,Fdistressing content
OL,9,FA woman who had been drugged and raped
OL,10,Fby her husband for 20 years asked
OL,11,Fpolice: "Is it my fault he's done
OL,12,Fthis?".
OL,14,FThe husband, who cannot be named to
OL,15,Fprotect his wife's legal right to
OL,16,Fanonymity, has admitted a litany of
OL,17,Foffences against her - including rape,
OL,18,Fadministering a substance with intent
OL,19,Fand inviting 13 other men to join the
OL,20,Fabuse.
